      "id": "D025-E01",
      "heading": "Alert transition catalogue",
      "text": "The catalogue separates transitions that create receiver deliveries from events that remain in audit history. A subscription must name the event precisely; alert.opened and alert.resolved are not interchangeable. The payload key identifies the object a consumer should correlate. Do not interpret the absence of a callback for an audit-only event as evidence that the alert engine failed.",
